    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "methode",
     "title": "Négation",
     "md": "**didn't** (= did not) + verbe à l'**infinitif** : I **didn't go** to school. · She **didn't eat** rice.\nLe verbe ne prend **pas** la marque du passé (la marque est dans didn't)."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "methode",
     "title": "Question",
     "md": "**Did** + sujet + verbe à l'infinitif ? : **Did** you **go** to the market ?\nAvec un mot interrogatif : **Where did** you **go** ? · **What did** she **eat** ?\nRéponses courtes : **Yes, I did.** / **No, she didn't.**"
    },
